---@class azure.cloudhealth.DependenciesSignalGroupV2
---@field aggregationType azure.cloudhealth.DependenciesSignalGroupV2AggregationType|string Aggregation type for child dependencies.
---@field degradedThreshold? number Degraded threshold for aggregation. For MinHealthy: parent is degraded when healthy count/percentage falls to or below this value. For MaxNotHealthy: parent is degraded when not-healthy count/percentage reaches or exceeds this value. Optional — if not set, there is no degraded state (transitions directly from Healthy to Unhealthy).
