---@field unit? azure.cloudhealth.AggregationUnit|string Unit type for the aggregation thresholds. Required when aggregationType is MinHealthy or MaxNotHealthy.
---@field ignoreUnknown? boolean If true, children with Unknown health state are excluded from aggregation calculations. Defaults to true.

